        "Isolated brachydactyly without hormone resistance",
        "Absence of facial dysmorphism",
        "No intellectual disability"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "albright-osteodystrophy",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Similar skeletal abnormalities but with obesity and subcutaneous ossifications",
        "Different hormone resistance profile",
        "GNAS mutations"
      ]
    }
  ],
